---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p>Last updated: January 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">Informational Purpose Only</h2>
    <p>
      The pricing comparisons, calculator estimates, and fee analyses provided on StackCost Matrix are gathered from public documentation and verified user reports. 
      While we update our dataset frequently, cloud vendors frequently adjust their billing tiers. Always verify current pricing on the official vendor website before deploying production architectures.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p>
      StackCost Matrix shall not be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from cloud billing overages, architecture decisions, or vendor service modifications.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
